Actual artifact Blobs are:
- stored;
- hashed on intake;
- read back;
- rehashed;
- marked unavailable when verification fails.

Byte-dependent work blocks when bytes are unavailable or unverified.

35.4 Storage status

At startup, the application should request persistent storage and estimate quota.
The result is displayed honestly.
Browser-local storage is not represented as protection from device, browser-profile, or browser loss.

